@startuml 09-Tactic-UI
' 6층 Tactic — 전투 씬 UI. HUD는 CombatManager · BattleInput 프리팹이 화면을 쥐고,
' 모달 일부(총공격 편집 · 보상 카드 · 결과 · 재시작)는 코드로 캔버스를 짓는다.
title 6층 Tactic — 클래스 다이어그램 (전투 UI)

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "6 Tactic — UI" {
  class BulletTimeGaugeUI <<MonoBehaviour>> {
    .. 화면 아래 총공격 게이지 ..
  }
  class BulletTimeGaugeWidget {
    + ShownRatio : float
    + {static} Chase(cur, target, dt) : float
  }
  class AssaultEditorUI <<MonoBehaviour>> {
    + {static} IsOpen : bool
    + {static} RequestOpen()
    .. 총공격 4슬롯 편집(E키) · GameplayModal에 등록 ..
  }
  class CardRewardSession <<MonoBehaviour>> {
    + {static} IsOpen : bool
    + {static} RequestOpen()
    .. 칸을 깨면 카드 세 장 중 하나 · GameplayModal에 등록 ..
  }
  class SkillCutinUI <<MonoBehaviour>> {
    + Duration : float
    + SlideIn · Hold · SlideOut
  }
  class DeckInspectorUI <<MonoBehaviour>>
  class PartyHealthHUD <<MonoBehaviour>>
  class RecentHitEnemyHUD <<MonoBehaviour>> {
    + CurrentTarget : Combat
    + Track(attacker, target)
  }
  class ComboDamageHUD <<MonoBehaviour>> {
    + Meter : ComboMeter
  }
  class ComboMeter {
    + Hits : int
    + Damage : float
  }
  class RebindUI <<MonoBehaviour>> {
    + Open() / Close()
  }
  class StageResultUI <<MonoBehaviour>> {
    + {static} Create(owner : Component)
    + ShowExitArrow(label)
    + ShowAllClear(menu)
    + ShowDefeat(retry, menu)
  }
  class BattleRestartUI <<MonoBehaviour>> {
    + {static} Create<T : Component, IStageRestarter>(owner)
    + SetVisible(value)
  }
  class TrainingDummy <<MonoBehaviour>> {
    .. 훈련장 DPS 측정 ..
  }
}

BulletTimeGaugeUI ..> "BulletTimeController" : 게이지 · 페이즈
BulletTimeGaugeUI *--> BulletTimeGaugeWidget
AssaultEditorUI ..> "RunProgression (5)" : AssaultSlots
AssaultEditorUI ..> "SkillFusion (5)" : 레벨 표시
AssaultEditorUI ..> "PlayerInputController (1.5)" : Navigate
CardRewardSession ..> "BulletTimeController" : GrantCard
CardRewardSession ..> "CardOfferRules · CardOfferView (5)"
CardRewardSession ..> "RunProgression (5)" : Grant
PartyHealthHUD ..> "PartyRoster" : Roster
SkillCutinUI ..|> "ISkillCutin"
ComboDamageHUD *--> ComboMeter
RecentHitEnemyHUD ..> "EliteMarkRules (4)"
RebindUI ..> "RebindManager (1.5)"
BattleRestartUI o--> "IStageRestarter"
@enduml
